WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.089 --> 00:00:05.350
Speaker 1: According to a new poll, a majority
of Americans, including a large percentage

00:00:05.350 --> 00:00:13.260
of non vaccinated Americans, actually are
OK with vaccine mandates.

00:00:13.260 --> 00:00:14.490
This is remarkable.

00:00:14.490 --> 00:00:19.060
Here it is, according to a late July morning
consult poll.

00:00:19.060 --> 00:00:24.539
Fifty six percent of adults said employers
should probably or definitely require covid-19

00:00:24.539 --> 00:00:28.199
vaccinations for their employees and customers.

00:00:28.199 --> 00:00:32.210
Only 32 percent said they probably or definitely
should not.

00:00:32.210 --> 00:00:34.250
That confidence extends to schools to.

00:00:34.250 --> 00:00:38.760
Last month, Gallup found that 60 percent of
Americans supported mandatory vaccines for

00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:43.280
high school students and 56 percent supported
them for middle school students.

00:00:43.280 --> 00:00:46.969
Although among K through 12 parents, those
numbers were notably lower 47 percent and

00:00:46.969 --> 00:00:50.239
43 percent respectively.

00:00:50.239 --> 00:00:57.360
And 28 percent of unvaccinated people actually
support mandatory vaccines.

00:00:57.360 --> 00:01:00.700
So all this fear mongering that we see.

00:01:00.700 --> 00:01:05.549
Coming from the right, mostly, there is still
some coming from some folks who claim to be

00:01:05.549 --> 00:01:08.869
on the left, but.

00:01:08.869 --> 00:01:13.979
It's all for lack of a better term nonsense,
it's B.S.

00:01:13.979 --> 00:01:18.299
We don't want mass mandates, actually look
at the polls, people do.

00:01:18.299 --> 00:01:19.579
They're OK with it.

00:01:19.579 --> 00:01:23.840
They don't see it as a violation of their
freedom.

00:01:23.840 --> 00:01:25.520
They see it as protecting other people.

00:01:25.520 --> 00:01:29.689
Hell, when you have twenty eight percent of
people who aren't even vaccinated yet saying,

00:01:29.689 --> 00:01:35.149
yes, this thing should be mandatory, that
tells you a lot here.

00:01:35.149 --> 00:01:39.380
And unfortunately, that is probably where
we're headed.

00:01:39.380 --> 00:01:44.619
I say, unfortunately, because there are still
people who are hugely against this.

00:01:44.619 --> 00:01:48.119
And I wish we honestly didn't have to get
to the point where we had to mandate this

00:01:48.119 --> 00:01:49.670
thing.

00:01:49.670 --> 00:01:55.700
But too many people fell for the misinformation,
too many people fell for the lies, and so

00:01:55.700 --> 00:01:57.419
now here we are.

00:01:57.419 --> 00:02:03.319
It would have been great if we had every eligible
and healthy enough person, because that's

00:02:03.319 --> 00:02:05.319
an important distinction to make.

00:02:05.319 --> 00:02:08.039
Who was able to get the vaccine if they had
gotten the vaccine?

00:02:08.039 --> 00:02:12.410
And we wouldn't even be talking about a Delta
variant today, maybe.

00:02:12.410 --> 00:02:15.760
And about that distinction real quick, because
I do want to point out, yes, there are plenty

00:02:15.760 --> 00:02:21.680
of people here in the United States who are
physically incapable of getting that vaccine,

00:02:21.680 --> 00:02:26.819
you know, immunocompromised people, people
allergic to some of the things in the vaccine

00:02:26.819 --> 00:02:27.860
so they can't get it.

00:02:27.860 --> 00:02:31.540
And trust me, whenever I talk about things
like this, I'm not saying you guys should

00:02:31.540 --> 00:02:33.069
have to get it at all.

00:02:33.069 --> 00:02:34.069
You can not.

00:02:34.069 --> 00:02:37.129
It puts you in danger when you get the vaccine.

00:02:37.129 --> 00:02:43.069
So even if we ended up with any kind of vaccine
mandates, I think they would definitely have

00:02:43.069 --> 00:02:48.079
to carve out that exception for those individuals.

00:02:48.079 --> 00:02:51.629
But if it's just somebody who says, no, I
don't want to get it because I saw a video

00:02:51.629 --> 00:02:53.900
and a woman said it made her magnetic.

00:02:53.900 --> 00:02:59.920
OK, you know what, that's not a valid reason,
because that's not actually a thing that happened.

00:02:59.920 --> 00:03:05.390
And I'm sure we've all seen that video from
from Ohio where they were having the hearing

00:03:05.390 --> 00:03:08.520
and the woman came in and said, look, even
my keys stick to me.

00:03:08.520 --> 00:03:14.120
And then the key didn't then stick to her
because she's not magnetic.

00:03:14.120 --> 00:03:20.189
And I think David actually pointed out on
social media, has anybody even thought about

00:03:20.189 --> 00:03:22.299
maybe being magnetic isn't that bad?

00:03:22.299 --> 00:03:24.459
You know what what really is the drawback
to that?

00:03:24.459 --> 00:03:30.099
It was humorous, of course, but here's the
thing, and this isn't so funny.

00:03:30.099 --> 00:03:32.560
We're at a point.

00:03:32.560 --> 00:03:38.250
Were most people in this country who are of
eligible age?

00:03:38.250 --> 00:03:44.969
There's no longer the long lines, there's
no longer the fight to get in to get the vaccine,

00:03:44.969 --> 00:03:47.840
they're open.

00:03:47.840 --> 00:03:52.489
You can go to most pharmacies here in the
United States.

00:03:52.489 --> 00:03:56.870
If if there is a line, you're going to wait
a couple of minutes and you can go and get

00:03:56.870 --> 00:04:00.239
this vaccine.

00:04:00.239 --> 00:04:05.590
It's it really is that simple for those who
are eligible and are not in any kind of danger

00:04:05.590 --> 00:04:09.150
when receiving the vaccine.

00:04:09.150 --> 00:04:11.670
That's where we're at.

00:04:11.670 --> 00:04:15.569
And most Americans understand that, and I
think that's why these poll numbers are the

00:04:15.569 --> 00:04:17.560
way that they are.

00:04:17.560 --> 00:04:21.479
Because people see, you know what, we could
be getting this, yes, covid is getting worse

00:04:21.479 --> 00:04:24.450
and I see that now.

00:04:24.450 --> 00:04:30.729
Not to mention, of course, all of the stories
that we've seen of people who didn't get vaccinated

00:04:30.729 --> 00:04:46.040
then died.

00:04:46.040 --> 00:05:35.830
And unfortunately, we have another one 
of those

